{
  "source": "Project-internal EC arithmetic checks covering short-Weierstrass point validation, affine vs Jacobian operations, scalar multiplication variants, and SEC1 point encodings. Group law formulas follow standard references like SEC 1: Elliptic Curve Cryptography (Version 2.0), Section 2.3.",
